      "sourceTextSha256": "c3d1665ccdeedc2d723261236c9284d8e956cfa71e1a524ade663a448a4b0e32",
      "text": "After breakfast, we set off for the Serra da Bodoquena mountain range. Departure is scheduled for 7:00 a.m.\n\nThe route includes a 5.5 km walk through the jungle to 12 waterfalls. Boca da Onça, the highest waterfall in southern Mato Grosso, drops 156 metres. You can swim at some of the waterfalls and see caves with stalactites behind the curtain of water.\n\nAfter lunch, you can rest in a hammock or swim in natural pools. We then continue to Bonito, where rafting is planned on arrival.",
